<div class="mandarin-hanzi">朋友</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">péngyou</div>

''Meaning:'' friend  
''Part of speech:'' noun

!! In context
我的朋友在学校工作。 — Wǒ de péngyou zài xuéxiào gōngzuò. — My friend works at a school.

!! Usage note
The second syllable is commonly neutral. 我的朋友 (wǒ de péngyou) means 'my friend'.
